                        Relaciones Exteriores</hi>, 1942–1943 (Mexico, D. F., 1943), pp.
                    457–460.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d417-f3" n="53" xml:id="d417-f3-content">
                <p>E. Padilla, Mexican Foreign Minister.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d417-f4" n="54" xml:id="d417-f4-content">
                <p>Gen. Wladyslaw Sikorski, Polish Prime Minister.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
